  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indo-Pacific Centre for Development Futures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment establishes the Indo-Pacific Development Centre (IPDC &#x2013; renamed from the initial IPCDF). The IPDC is a new research centre dedicated to producing research, analysis, and commentary on the most pressing economic and development challenges facing the Indo-Pacific region.

The IPDC has six thematic areas of focus: post covid recovery, growth and development; climate finance and decarbonising development; technology and the digital economy; globalisation and regional integration; the future of international development finance; and geoeconomics and the intersection of development and security.

IPDC also incorporates the flagship Lowy Southeast Asia Aid Map and Pacific Aid Map projects.</narrative>
  </description>
